{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2021-04-26 10:00:00', 'title': 'P&G VENTURES ANNOUNCES ITS NEXT VIRTUAL INNOVATION CHALLENGE - INVITING ENTREPRENEURS AND STARTUPS TO PITCH THEIR IDEA FOR THE NEXT GREAT CPG BRAND', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 P&G VENTURES, THE EARLY-STAGE STARTUP STUDIO WITHIN PROCTER & GAMBLE (NYSE: PG), IS NOW ACCEPTING SUBMISSIONS FROM ENTREPRENEURS, INVENTORS, AND STARTUPS FOR ITS NEXT VIRTUAL INNOVATION CHALLENGE. BUILDING ON THE SUCCESS OF ITS PREVIOUS INNOVATION CHALLENGES, P&G VENTURES IS ONCE AGAIN HOLDING THE COMPETITION VIRTUALLY TO MAKE THE CHALLENGE OPEN TO THE WIDEST POOL OF ENTREPRENEURS.'}